  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-1f46a1b8e401c8bf502201e4",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "温度控制系统的设计步骤包括：3. 预留附加裕度（~10°）并确定所需的最大相位超前量 φmax。4. 由式 (6.40) 或图 6.53 确定 α。5. 在截止频率处选取 ωmax；零点位于 ωmax√α，极点位于 ωmax/√α。6. 绘制校正后的频率响应并校验相角裕度（PM）。7. 迭代设计。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The design procedure for the temperature control system includes: 3. Allow for extra margin (~10°) and determine needed phase lead φmax. 4. Determine α from Eq. (6.40) or Fig. 6.53. 5. Pick ωmax at crossover frequency; zero at ωmax√α, pole at ωmax/√α. 6. Draw compensated frequency response and check PM. 7. Iterate on design.",
